=====================================================================
Cross-domain metadata for TruthfulQA, CommonsenseQA, MATH-500
(data/cross_domain/, fields that reference upstream IDs)

The original question text of these datasets is NOT redistributed here.
We only release category mappings, IDs, and derived evaluation outputs.
Users must obtain the original datasets from their official sources and
comply with their respective licenses:

- TruthfulQA:      Apache-2.0, https://github.com/sylinrl/TruthfulQA
- CommonsenseQA:   MIT,         https://www.tau-nlp.sites.tau.ac.il/commonsenseqa
- MATH-500:        MIT,         https://huggingface.co/datasets/HuggingFaceH4/MATH-500
=====================================================================

=====================================================================
Model outputs and judge outputs

Redistribution of model-generated text (target candidates, judge rationales)
is subject to the Terms of Service of the corresponding model providers.

- We release the target-model selections, target-model reported confidences,
  and judge votes in aggregate form as CSV/JSONL (no full rationale text).
- Raw rationale strings are NOT redistributed; they can be regenerated via
  the provided pipeline scripts with the relevant API/model access.
=====================================================================
